cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it with the metadata below, and cite
  the companion paper for the methods.
type: software
title: "statespacecheck: Goodness-of-fit diagnostics for state space models"
abstract: >-
  Local goodness-of-fit diagnostics for state space models: for each
  observation, down to individual spikes, HPD overlap, KL divergence and a
  predictive p-value comparing the model's one-step predictive distribution
  with the observation's likelihood, to find when and where a decoder
  disagrees with the data.
